# Build artifacts and caches — use **/ so nested copies (api/src/__pycache__,
# app/node_modules, …) are excluded too, not just the context root.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.venv
**/venv
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.coverage
**/htmlcov
